# 2026-09-16 — agreed next automation step

After the new Git/MCT base is validated:

1. Treat rollout.csv as the single source of truth for the active MCT classes.
2. Generate hosts/bunnyXX.nix including forgejo/name/email.
3. Automate cloning the approved golden image for all active VMs.
4. Automate boot -> nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#bunnyXX -> validation -> shutdown.
5. Extend class bootstrap to Forgejo:
   - ensure master branch protection,
   - create each student branch initially at master,
   - keep API tokens only on the teacher/admin machine, never in images/repos.
6. Bootstrap the class-specific MCT course repository per clone (mct.student, hook, VS Code read-only settings).

Golden-image construction itself stays a deliberately reviewed/manual boundary.

